{"title":"My Plant Catalogue","markdown":{"yaml":{"title":"My Plant Catalogue","sidebar":false,"page-layout":"full"},"headingText":"A","headingAttr":{"id":"A","classes":[],"keyvalue":[]},"containsRefs":false,"markdown":"\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n\nHere you can find a depository of my most precious botanical anectodes. Every plant has a story to tell, but the way we connect with them is also deeply personal. So while browsing this catalogue, do not be surprised to encounter for instance quite a few violets while going through the \"V\" section. If you prefer a more spontaneous approach, you can also use this magic button to randomly pick a plant card. Maybe you'll learn something!\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<button onclick=\"randomPlant()\" class=\"btn btn-success\">\nMagic button, show me a random plant\n</button>\n</div>\n\n<div id=\"random-output\"></div>\n\n<br>\n\nNB: If you ever visit the places where these pictures were taken in search of the species, please note that I cannot guarantee they are still there, as I am not fully aware of the evolution of these botanical collections (or mother nature's gardening plans).\n\n</div>\n\n<br>\n\n<a href=\"#A\">A</a> |\n<a href=\"#B\">B</a> |\n<a href=\"#C\">C</a> |\n<a href=\"#D\">D</a> |\n<a href=\"#E\">E</a> |\n<a href=\"#F\">F</a> |\n<a href=\"#G\">G</a> |\n<a href=\"#H\">H</a> |\n<a href=\"#I\">I</a> |\n<a href=\"#J\">J</a> |\n<a href=\"#K\">K</a> |\n<a href=\"#L\">L</a> |\n<a href=\"#M\">M</a> |\n<a href=\"#N\">N</a> |\n<a href=\"#O\">O</a> |\n<a href=\"#P\">P</a> |\n<a href=\"#Q\">Q</a> |\n<a href=\"#R\">R</a> |\n<a href=\"#S\">S</a> |\n<a href=\"#T\">T</a> |\n<a href=\"#U\">U</a> |\n<a href=\"#V\">V</a> |\n<a href=\"#W\">W</a> |\n<a href=\"#X\">X</a> |\n<a href=\"#Y\">Y</a> |\n<a href=\"#Z\">Z</a>\n\n---\n\n\n## B {#B}\n\n## C {#C}\n\n## D {#D}\n\n## E {#E}\n\n## F {#F}\n\n## G {#G}\n\n## H {#H}\n\n## I {#I}\n\n## J {#J}\n\n## K {#K}\n\n## L {#L}\n\n## M {#M}\n\n<div class=\"plant-card\">\n\n### *Maxillaria tenuifolia Lindl.*\n\n![](images/plantcatalogue/maxillariatenuifolia.png){width=400px}\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"plant-card\">\n\n### *Melaleuca citrina (Curtis) Dum.Cours.*\n\n![](images/plantcatalogue/melaleucacitrina.png){width=400px}\n\n</div>\n\n## N {#N}\n\n## O {#O}\n\n## P {#P}\n\n<div class=\"plant-card\">\n\n### *Passiflora foetida L.*\n\n![](images/plantcatalogue/passiflorafoetida.png){width=400px}\n\n</div>\n\n## Q {#Q}\n\n## R {#R}\n\n## S {#S}\n\n<div class=\"plant-card\">\n\n### *Stylidium debile F.Muell.*\n\n![](images/plantcatalogue/stylidiumdebile.png){width=400px}\n\n</div>\n\n## T {#T}\n\n## U {#U}\n\n## V {#V}\n\n<div class=\"plant-card\">\n\n### *Viola canadensis L.*\n\n![](images/plantcatalogue/violacanadensis.png){width=400px}\n\n</div>\n\n## W {#W}\n\n## X {#X}\n\n## Y {#Y}\n\n## Z {#Z}\n\n<script>\n\nfunction randomPlant() {\n\n  const cards = document.querySelectorAll('.plant-card img');\n\n  const randomIndex = Math.floor(Math.random() * cards.length);\n\n  const chosenImg = cards[randomIndex].src;\n\n  document.getElementById('random-output').innerHTML = `\n    <img src=\"${chosenImg}\" \n         style=\"\n           width: 800px;\n           border-radius: 12px;\n           margin-top: 20px;\n         \">\n  `;\n}\n\n</script>","srcMarkdownNoYaml":"\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n\nHere you can find a depository of my most precious botanical anectodes. Every plant has a story to tell, but the way we connect with them is also deeply personal. So while browsing this catalogue, do not be surprised to encounter for instance quite a few violets while going through the \"V\" section. If you prefer a more spontaneous approach, you can also use this magic button to randomly pick a plant card. Maybe you'll learn something!\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<button onclick=\"randomPlant()\" class=\"btn btn-success\">\nMagic button, show me a random plant\n</button>\n</div>\n\n<div id=\"random-output\"></div>\n\